# Typing into a card's text field (decision 015): one draft at a time, on the
# card that's shown; it keeps the card open and goes with it.

scenario: focusing only works on the card that's shown
start timer
focus timer add                     -> draft=none           # not expanded
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer
focus other add                     -> draft=none           # not this card
focus timer add                     -> draft=empty

scenario: typing, erasing a whole character, submitting keeps focus
start timer
click
focus timer add
type café                           -> draft=café
erase                               -> draft=caf            # é is two bytes: both go
erase
erase
erase                               -> draft=empty
erase                               -> draft=empty          # nothing left: no-op
type milk
submit                              -> draft=empty Expanded # sent; ready for the next one

scenario: typing with no field focused does nothing
start timer
click
type hello                          -> draft=none

scenario: Esc in the field cancels typing, not the card
start timer
click
focus timer add
type hello
cancel-input                        -> draft=none Expanded

scenario: the draft goes with its card
start timer
start media
click                               -> expanded=media
switch timer
focus timer add
type hello
switch media                        -> draft=none
switch timer
focus timer add
type hello
outside                             -> draft=none Split

scenario: unsent text keeps the card open; an empty field doesn't
start timer
click
focus timer add
type hello
wait 20000                          -> Expanded draft=hello
erase
erase
erase
erase
erase
wait 7999                           -> Expanded             # erasing counts as activity
wait 1                              -> Compact draft=none

scenario: a dormant panel's card takes typing too
panel focus
click
tile focus
focus focus add                     -> draft=empty
type x
home                                -> draft=none

scenario: a field's unsent text survives the card closing and tab switches (decision 050)
start timer
start media
click                               -> expanded=media
switch timer
focus timer add
type buy milk
switch media                        -> draft=none           # the field lost focus...
switch timer
focus timer add                     -> draft=buy_milk caret=8   # ...and its text came back
outside                             -> Split draft=none
click
switch timer
focus timer add                     -> draft=buy_milk       # closed and reopened: still there
cancel-input                        -> draft=none           # Esc stops typing
focus timer add                     -> draft=buy_milk       # the text waits
submit                              -> draft=empty          # sent: gone
cancel-input
focus timer add                     -> draft=empty          # nothing kept once sent

scenario: each field keeps its own text; edits in place aren't kept
start timer
click
focus timer add
type first
focus timer other
type second
focus timer add                     -> draft=first
focus timer other                   -> draft=second
edit timer todo.edit.1 name
type x
cancel-input
edit timer todo.edit.1 name         -> draft=name           # an edit starts from the task's text, not leftovers
